# CQ-06 · composition-depicts
#
# Question: Is there a Composition anywhere in the corpus that depicts nothing?
# Persona:  P1 — generation-pipeline engineer. An empty scene is the failure
#           mode of a model that emitted a frame block and then stopped.
# Spec:     docs/vson.md §2 clause C4; §5.2 (`vso:depicts`)
# Form:     ASK — a conformant corpus answers false
# Note:     C4 is enforced by `vss:CompositionShape`; this asks the same
#           question of the corpus from the outside, which is what makes the
#           shape's verdict checkable by someone who does not run pyshacl.
PREFIX vso: <https://w3id.org/vson/v1/ontology#>

ASK {
  ?scene a vso:Composition .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?scene vso:depicts ?anything }
}
